#: schedutils/taskset.c:69
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The default behavior is to run a new command:\n"
"    %1$s 03 sshd -b 1024\n"
"You can retrieve the mask of an existing task:\n"
"    %1$s -p 700\n"
"Or set it:\n"
"    %1$s -p 03 700\n"
"List format uses a comma-separated list instead of a mask:\n"
"    %1$s -pc 0,3,7-11 700\n"
"Ranges in list format can take a stride argument:\n"
"    e.g. 0-31:2 is equivalent to mask 0x55555555\n"
msgstr ""
"Uobičajeno ponašanje je da se pokrene nova komanda:\n"
"    %1$s 03 sshd -b 1024\n"
"Možete dobiti masku postojećeg zadatka:\n"
"    %1$s -p 700\n"
"Ili je postaviti:\n"
"    %1$s -p 03 700\n"
"Format liste koristi zarezom odvojenu listu umjesto maske:\n"
"    %1$s -pc 0,3,7-11 700\n"
"Raspon u formatu liste može primiti korak kao argument:\n"
"    npr. 0-31:2 je ekvivalentno maski 0x55555555\n"

